PDM1SPIHID tells the Touch Bar driver about the Fn key and typing.

Applied by ../build-spihid.nix to a copy of ../../m1-trackpad-child/multitouch (PDM1SPIHID.cpp,
PDM1SPIHID.h, CMakeLists.txt); the new code is PDM1SPIHIDTouchBar.inc, pd_hid_fn.c and
pd_touchbar_kbd.h of this directory. Nothing in the trackpad stream's directory is changed.

